{% if models.temperature == 0.0 and models.seed is not none %}
Temperature is zero and the seed is pinned, so a run is repeatable: the same
inputs against the same model version produce the same outputs.
{% else %}
The model is not configured deterministically. A qualification run executed
under this configuration cannot be repeated exactly, and the validation plan
must justify that choice.
